## Law-state route

```text
ontology.ttl
→ ggen graph admission
→ ggen-manufactured Main.lean
→ Lean kernel admission
→ Lean executable emits Rust
→ rustfmt + Clippy + tests
→ public Rust execution
→ BLAKE3 execution receipt bound to proof-receipt.json
```

