- Fixed-point theorem: `{{ p.fixed_point_theorem }}`

## Constitutional fence

The Rust crate is not a sibling projection of the source ontology. ggen first manufactures the Lean proof-and-emitter program. The Rust source is written only by the executable that Lean has compiled after checking the theorem bundle.

The v1 claim is deliberately bounded to a successor function with a finite natural-number cap. It does not claim general Lean extraction, arbitrary theorem-to-code synthesis, or semantic equivalence for unmodeled side effects.
